abstract: >
  A reproducible benchmark-aware workflow for regional validation of
  whole-genome sequencing variant calling using the Genome in a Bottle
  HG001 benchmark and GRCh38 chromosome 22 high-confidence regions.
  The workflow combines normalized bcftools isec comparison, formal
  RTG vcfeval benchmarking, benchmark-scale evaluation across
  progressively expanded regional sets, and systematic analysis of
  missed variants, low-recall regions, difficult genomic contexts,
  and discrepancies between benchmarking approaches.
